│ capsulitis, and comparing any manual therapy or exercise intervention versus placebo, no intervention, a different   │
│ type of manual therapy or exercise or any other intervention. Interventions included mobilisation, manipulation and  │
│ supervised or home exercise, delivered alone or in combination. Trials investigating the primary or adjunct effect   │
│ of a combination of manual therapy and exercise were the main comparisons of interest. Main outcomes of interest     │
│ were participant‐reported pain relief of 30% or greater, overall pain (mean or mean change), function, global        │
