│ therapy or exercise or any other intervention. Interventions included mobilisation, manipulation and supervised or   │
│ home exercise, delivered alone or in combination. Trials investigating the primary or adjunct effect of a            │
│ combination of manual therapy and exercise were the main comparisons of interest. Main outcomes of interest were     │
